-    - at least one inner sprite is also palette-keyed, so the outer cavity is adjacent
-      to multiple candidate border colors at once
-    - the output must fill the large outer cavity while leaving inner sprite borders
-      untouched, and then fill any inner holes owned by palette-keyed inner sprites
