+# f) Visual cleanliness
+# - Only three semantic structures appear in the play area: the palette, the outer
+#   shell, and the inner shell. No overlapping decorations or extra markers are added.
+# - Rectangular shells were chosen deliberately: they make the annulus and the inner
+#   hole easy to distinguish from each other.
+#
+# g) Color-change inferability
